{"seq":3,"slug":"ties-dare","title":"TIES 与 DARE：在相加之前先给任务向量做手术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/model-merging-techniques/methods/ties-dare","wordCount":1936,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"ties-与-dare-在相加之前先给任务向量做手术\">TIES 与 DARE：在相加之前先给任务向量做手术</h1><p><a href=\"task-arithmetic\">任务向量算术</a> 留下一个未解的痛：当你把三五个任务向量直接加回基座，它们会在同一个参数上互相拉扯——一个要往正走、一个要往负走，抵消之后两边能力都受损；再叠上海量幅度极小的「噪声改动」稀释信号，合并模型于是全线轻微退化。TIES 和 DARE 是 2023 年针对这个痛点提出的两套手术，思路不同但都指向同一个目标：让任务向量在相加前变得稀疏、干净、不打架。它们是 mergekit 中处理多模型合并最常用的两个算子，也是本 hub 干扰「消解机制」的主讲处。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>TIES 与 DARE 解决的是同一个敌人——任务向量相加时的<strong>参数干扰</strong>，但各自瞄准其中一个来源，手术手法截然不同。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[任务向量相加 ] --&gt; B[&quot;干扰来源一&lt;br/&gt;冗余干扰&lt;br/&gt;海量微小噪声累积&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;干扰来源二&lt;br/&gt;符号干扰&lt;br/&gt;同一参数正负抵消&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; D[&quot;DARE&lt;br/&gt;随机丢弃 90%+ 再重缩放&lt;br/&gt;稀疏化腾空间&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; E[&quot;TIES&lt;br/&gt;Trim 修剪 + Elect Sign 选举&lt;br/&gt;+ Disjoint Merge&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; F[&quot;DARE-TIES&lt;br/&gt;先稀疏化再消符号&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F\">flowchart TD\n    A[任务向量相加 ] --&gt; B[\"干扰来源一&lt;br/&gt;冗余干扰&lt;br/&gt;海量微小噪声累积\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"干扰来源二&lt;br/&gt;符号干扰&lt;br/&gt;同一参数正负抵消\"]\n    B --&gt; D[\"DARE&lt;br/&gt;随机丢弃 90%+ 再重缩放&lt;br/&gt;稀疏化腾空间\"]\n    C --&gt; E[\"TIES&lt;br/&gt;Trim 修剪 + Elect Sign 选举&lt;br/&gt;+ Disjoint Merge\"]\n    D --&gt; F[\"DARE-TIES&lt;br/&gt;先稀疏化再消符号\"]\n    E --&gt; F</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>来源与分工</strong>：干扰来自冗余（噪声累积淹没有效信号）与符号冲突（正负抵消两边都受损）；DARE 主攻冗余，TIES 正面消解符号，二者可叠加成 DARE-TIES。</li>\n<li><strong>TIES 三步</strong>：Trim 按幅度只留 top-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>（常保 20%）→ Elect Sign 逐参数比正负两派幅度和、选出胜出符号 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>γ</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0556em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> → Disjoint Merge 只平均与胜出符号一致的分量。</li>\n<li><strong>DARE 两步</strong>：以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>（常 ≥0.9）随机把 delta 置零 → 幸存分量乘 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/(1-p)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 保持期望不变；随机而非按幅度挑选，说明微调 delta 存在巨大冗余。</li>\n<li><strong>为什么几乎无损</strong>：微调位移落在平坦盆地里，绝大多数分量可有可无，真正定义能力的关键方向只占少数——TIES 靠幅度找它们，DARE 赌随机留下的一撮足以代表整体。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"干扰的两个来源\">干扰的两个来源</h2><p>先把敌人看清楚。TIES 论文（Yadav 等，2023，&quot;TIES-Merging&quot;）指出，任务向量相加时的干扰来自两处。</p>\n<p>其一是<strong>冗余干扰</strong>：单个任务向量里，真正重要的改动只占一小部分，大量分量幅度极小、接近噪声。把多个这样的稠密向量相加，噪声累积会淹没有效信号。</p>\n<p>其二是<strong>符号干扰</strong>：对某个参数，任务 A 的向量分量为正、任务 B 为负，二者相加后相互抵消，两个任务在这个参数上想要的效果都没实现。</p>\n<p>TIES 与 DARE 分别主攻这两个来源——TIES 正面消解符号冲突，DARE 用随机稀疏化削减冗余，二者还能叠加使用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ties-修剪-选举符号-按符号合并\">TIES：修剪、选举符号、按符号合并</h2><p>TIES 是 Trim, Elect Sign &amp; Merge 的缩写，正好对应它的三步流水线，作用在每一个任务向量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 上。</p>\n<p>第一步 <strong>Trim（修剪）</strong>：对每个任务向量，只保留幅度最大的 top-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>%（论文常用保留 20%，即丢弃 80%）分量，其余置零。这直接砍掉冗余干扰——反正它们幅度小、贡献低。</p>\n<p>第二步 <strong>Elect Sign（符号选举）</strong>：对每个参数位置，把所有任务向量在该位置的分量按符号分成正、负两派，比较两派各自的幅度总和，选出胜出的符号 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>γ</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma_p \\in \\{+1, -1\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8252em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0556em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>。这一步为每个参数定下「最终该往哪个方向走」的裁决。</p>\n<p>第三步 <strong>Disjoint Merge（按符号合并）</strong>：在每个参数位置，只把符号与选举结果 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>γ</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0556em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 一致的分量拿来求平均，与胜出符号相反的分量被丢弃、不参与。用公式表达，最终合并向量在位置 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 上为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>τ</mi><mi>p</mi><mtext>merged</mtext></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">A</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">A</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></munder><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">A</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>t</mi><mo>:</mo><mtext>sign</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>γ</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau^{\\text{merged}}_p = \\frac{1}{|\\mathcal{A}_p|} \\sum_{t \\in \\mathcal{A}_p} \\tau_{t,p}, \\quad \\mathcal{A}_p = \\{\\, t : \\text{sign}(\\tau_{t,p}) = \\gamma_p \\,\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2822em;vertical-align:-0.3831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">merged</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.8131em;vertical-align:-1.4917em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathcal mtight\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4917em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sign</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0556em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>最后照例缩放加回基座：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi><mtext> </mtext><msup><mi>τ</mi><mtext>merged</mtext></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta = \\theta_0 + \\lambda\\, \\tau^{\\text{merged}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">merged</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。三步下来，符号冲突被裁决、噪声被修剪，合并模型在多任务上的整体保留度显著优于朴素任务算术。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[各任务向量 τt] --&gt; B[Trim 修剪&lt;br/&gt;只留 top-20% 幅度分量]&#10;    B --&gt; C[Elect Sign 符号选举&lt;br/&gt;逐参数比正负两派幅度和]&#10;    C --&gt; D[Disjoint Merge&lt;br/&gt;只平均与胜出符号一致的分量]&#10;    D --&gt; E[缩放加回基座&lt;br/&gt;θ0 + λ·τmerged]\">flowchart TD\n    A[各任务向量 τt] --&gt; B[Trim 修剪&lt;br/&gt;只留 top-20% 幅度分量]\n    B --&gt; C[Elect Sign 符号选举&lt;br/&gt;逐参数比正负两派幅度和]\n    C --&gt; D[Disjoint Merge&lt;br/&gt;只平均与胜出符号一致的分量]\n    D --&gt; E[缩放加回基座&lt;br/&gt;θ0 + λ·τmerged]</pre><h2 id=\"dare-随机丢弃再重缩放\">DARE：随机丢弃再重缩放</h2><p>DARE（Drop And REscale，Yu 等，2023，论文别名 &quot;Language Models are Super Mario&quot;）走的是另一条更简单、也更出人意料的路。它对每个任务向量做两步。</p>\n<p>第一步 <strong>Drop（随机丢弃）</strong>：以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>（常取 0.9 甚至更高）<strong>随机</strong>把 delta 参数置零。注意是随机，不像 TIES 那样按幅度挑选——这正是它反直觉之处：丢掉 90% 的改动，模型能力竟几乎不损失，说明微调后的 delta 参数存在巨大冗余。</p>\n<p>第二步 <strong>Rescale（重缩放）</strong>：把幸存的分量放大 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{1-p}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3262em;vertical-align:-0.4811em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4811em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 倍，以保持整体期望不变：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>τ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>M</mi><mo>⊙</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∼</mo><mtext>Bernoulli</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tilde{\\tau} = \\frac{1}{1-p}\\, M \\odot \\tau, \\quad M_i \\sim \\text{Bernoulli}(1-p)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.35em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2019em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊙</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Bernoulli</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 是随机 0/1 掩码，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>⊙</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\odot</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">⊙</span></span></span></span></span> 是逐元素乘。重缩放是关键——只丢不缩放会让 delta 整体变弱，缩放后期望上等价于原向量。DARE 的价值在于：经它稀疏化后的任务向量彼此重叠大幅减少，多个模型「腾出了空间」互不踩踏，于是能塞进更多模型而干扰更小。DARE 本身不做符号裁决，因此常与 TIES 组合成 <strong>DARE-TIES</strong>：先用 DARE 随机稀疏化，再用 TIES 的符号选举合并，兼得两者之长。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ties-与-dare-的对比\">TIES 与 DARE 的对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>TIES</th>\n<th>DARE</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>稀疏化依据</td>\n<td>按幅度保留 top-k</td>\n<td>随机丢弃</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是否处理符号冲突</td>\n<td>是（符号选举）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是否重缩放幸存值</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是（乘 1/(1−p)）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型稀疏率</td>\n<td>保留约 20%</td>\n<td>丢弃 90%+</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单用效果</td>\n<td>强于任务算术</td>\n<td>需配合合并算子</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>常见组合</td>\n<td>可作 DARE 的下游</td>\n<td>DARE-TIES</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个常见问题是「到底用哪个」。经验法则：模型数量不多、任务冲突明显时，TIES 的符号选举收益最直接；要塞进很多模型、追求彼此互不干扰时，DARE 的随机稀疏更能腾空间；不确定时，DARE-TIES 组合是 mergekit 社区的稳妥默认。这些选择的调参层面——丢弃率设多少、密度预算怎么分配、系数怎么搜——留给实践篇 <a href=\"../practice/interference-mitigation\">干扰缓解</a> 详述，本篇只负责讲清机制本身。</p>\n<h2 id=\"稀疏化为何几乎无损-一点直觉\">稀疏化为何几乎无损：一点直觉</h2><p>DARE 丢掉九成 delta 还能工作，初看像变魔术，但结合 <a href=\"../foundations/merging-intuition\">权重空间与线性模式连通</a> 的盆地视角就不奇怪：微调位移落在一个平坦盆地里，盆地平坦意味着「往哪个方向走一点点损失都变化不大」，因此位移向量的绝大多数分量都是可有可无的冗余，真正定义能力的只是少数关键方向。TIES 按幅度找这些关键方向，DARE 则赌「随机留下的一小撮足以代表整体」，重缩放补回强度。两种手术殊途同归，都是在利用微调改动的高度冗余性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>任务向量相加的干扰来自冗余（噪声累积）与符号冲突（正负抵消）两处，TIES 与 DARE 分别主攻。</li>\n<li>TIES 三步：Trim 修剪 top-k、Elect Sign 逐参数符号选举、Disjoint Merge 只平均同符号分量，正面消解符号冲突。</li>\n<li>DARE 两步：随机丢弃 90%+ 的 delta、幸存值乘 1/(1−p) 重缩放，靠稀疏化腾出空间，常与 TIES 组合成 DARE-TIES。</li>\n<li>稀疏化几乎无损的直觉：微调位移在平坦盆地里高度冗余，关键方向只占少数。</li>\n<li>机制在本篇，丢弃率/密度预算/系数搜索等调参在实践篇的干扰缓解。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>被清理的对象及其算术：<a href=\"task-arithmetic\">任务向量算术</a></li>\n<li>稀疏化无损的几何直觉：<a href=\"../foundations/merging-intuition\">权重空间与线性模式连通</a></li>\n<li>丢弃率与系数的工程调参：<a href=\"../practice/interference-mitigation\">干扰缓解</a></li>\n<li>另一条压制干扰的路线（加权而非稀疏）：<a href=\"../advanced/fisher-regmean\">Fisher 与 RegMean</a></li>\n<li>跨库延伸——DARE 常用于合并 LoRA 微调产物：<a href=\"../../llm-fine-tuning/parameter-efficient-methods/lora\">LLM 微调 · LoRA</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"TIES 与 DARE：在相加之前先给任务向量做手术","id":"ties-与-dare-在相加之前先给任务向量做手术"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"干扰的两个来源","id":"干扰的两个来源"},{"level":2,"text":"TIES：修剪、选举符号、按符号合并","id":"ties-修剪-选举符号-按符号合并"},{"level":2,"text":"DARE：随机丢弃再重缩放","id":"dare-随机丢弃再重缩放"},{"level":2,"text":"TIES 与 DARE 的对比","id":"ties-与-dare-的对比"},{"level":2,"text":"稀疏化为何几乎无损：一点直觉","id":"稀疏化为何几乎无损-一点直觉"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"任务向量算术：把能力当成可加减的向量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/model-merging-techniques/methods/task-arithmetic"},"next":{"title":"Fisher 与 RegMean：给参数称重，或直接求闭式最优","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/model-merging-techniques/advanced/fisher-regmean"}}